sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor Customer
  participant UI as Panel UI
  participant NGX as Nginx
  participant HAP as HAProxy
  participant API as Panel API
  participant Redis
  participant Wallet as Wallet API
  participant PG as PostgreSQL
  participant Kafka

  Customer->>UI: open Panel
  UI->>NGX: POST /buy/confirm
  NGX->>HAP: forward
  HAP->>API: HTTP
  API->>Redis: session
  API->>Wallet: confirm
  Wallet->>PG: ledger write
  API->>Kafka: buy.confirmed
  API-->>UI: 200
